{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "librarian-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 6380,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# Proposed to-be ingestion: accountable mixed processing and separate decisions\n**Symptom:** The corrected current parent needs delegated direction, trustworthy group receipts and complete mixed-item decision accounting.\n**Root cause:** Lead owns the commissioned parent; kind-specific children return evidence to the original ledger and independent review precedes the final handback.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `proposed-ingestion.spec.yaml`."
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "● start",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**1.** states the ingestion goal, roots, pre-read exclusions, required outputs, permitted partials and budget; grants only the intended authority",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dentry",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ commissioning route?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**2.** commissions the Lead on the Owner's behalf and supplies the agent-authored obligations for independent Oracle review",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Tier 0 agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-directowner",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "commissions the Lead directly and supplies or approves the obligations; no tier-0 agent is required",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**3.** owns execution against the commissioned specification; asks Core to store its version, grants and actual specification owner",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**4.** inventories roots, fingerprints and literal facts; excludes hidden/scratch content before reading and resolves deepest-root ownership",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-d1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ reviewed roots current?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**5.** binds the Owner's exclusions, purpose constraints and decision grants to the eligible worklist",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-r1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2440,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "⇉ **UC-D**: evaluates accepted R1 for stale evidence using its actual whole-library radius; a local mandate cannot silently permit a global rebuild",
      "color": "2",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Doctor"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-d2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ assigned folder-review role qualified on its selected route?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-xp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 24740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns the paused package and named required decision directly to the Owner or through the overseer; retains completed work",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-xe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 22340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns unresolved fault evidence to the actual specification owner and immediately notifies the Owner/overseer for critical findings",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 2540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**6.** interprets folder purpose, proposes descriptions and judges sensitivity; may direct bounded Scribe tasks",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Clerk (tier 2)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-r2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2440,
      "y": 2340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "⇉ **UC-D**: restores confirmed lost qualification with accepted R2; provider timeouts and parser faults retain their distinct evidence",
      "color": "2",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Doctor"
      }
    },
    {
