      "type": "text",
      "x": 6040,
      "y": 24940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ paused for a named Owner/authority decision, cancellation, interruption or ceiling stop; truthful continuation retained\n*outcome: paused*",
      "color": "1"
